{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017zfKgThQCZUtMLaGR8iKJa","type":"tool_result","content":"104:PAIRWISE_ALIAS_PROMPT = \"\"\"Decide whether these two names refer to the SAME PERSON in this novel.\n105-\n106-NAME A: {name_a}\n107-MENTIONS A: {mentions_a}\n108-CHAPTERS A: {chapters_a}\n109-CONTEXT A:\n110-{contexts_a}\n111-\n112-NAME B: {name_b}\n113-MENTIONS B: {mentions_b}\n114-CHAPTERS B: {chapters_b}\n115-CONTEXT B:\n116-{contexts_b}\n117-\n118-Rules:\n119-- Only say same_person=true if there is strong evidence they are the same character (name overlap, title variants, obvious nickname/full-name relationship, or clear contextual cues).\n120-- If the only overlap is a last name, be VERY cautious (family members/spouses share last names).\n121-- If they never appear in overlapping chapters, be cautious unless it's clearly a full-name/short-name relationship.\n122-\n123-Return JSON:\n124-{{\n125-  \"same_person\": true/false,\n126-  \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0,\n127-  \"canonical\": \"Which of the two names should be canonical if same_person=true (must be exactly one of the provided names)\",\n128-  \"alias\": \"The other name if same_person=true (must be exactly one of the provided names)\",\n129-  \"reason\": \"brief justification\"\n130-}}\"\"\"\n131-\n132-\n133-ALIAS_RESOLUTION_SYSTEM = \"\"\"You are a literary analyst identifying character aliases.\n134-\n--\n201:ALIAS_RESOLUTION_PROMPT = \"\"\"Identify which character names refer to the SAME PERSON in this novel.\n202-\n203-CHARACTER NAMES (with chapter info and sample contexts):\n204-{characters}\n205-\n206-ANALYZE CAREFULLY:\n207-1. Check if names appear in similar chapters (overlapping chapters = might be same person)\n208-2. Check if contexts suggest the same person\n209-3. Look at mention counts - if both names have many mentions (50+), they're likely different major characters\n210-4. Check for gendered title conflicts (Mr. vs Mrs. suggests different people)\n211-5. Whe